# Keep heavy / non-runtime files out of the Vercel deployment upload.
# (Does not change app features — these are never imported by the web app.)
# Stale bun.lock must not be scanned by the TanStack Start XSS deploy gate.
bun.lock
*.zip
*.sql
docs/
supabase/seed/
supabase/manual/
public/byod/
.git/
*.md
!README.md
